1.0.2 - 2026-09-15
- Raised the supported Cacti baseline to patched 1.2.31+.
- Added explicit CSRF token handling for administration and drag/drop writes.
- Blocked deleted hosts, disabled racks, and unauthorized device detail lookups.
- Aligned the schema version marker with the plugin package version.
- Enforced the same 1.2.31+ minimum in the installer guard.
- Added a dedicated visible Rack Topology sidebar section with Rack View and Manage racks links.

1.0.0 - 2026-09-14
- Initial ICCT rack topology implementation.
- Front/rear rack visualization and live Cacti device status.
- Rack and placement CRUD with overlap validation.
- Drag-and-drop move support.
- View/Manage realms and audit trail.
- Cross-platform Windows/RHEL plugin design with no Cacti core edits.

1.0.1
- Fixed Cacti 1.2.x navigation integration.
- Added Rack Topology to Console > Management.
- Added Rack Topology Management to Console > Configuration.
- Registered both top_header_tabs and top_graph_header_tabs.
- Added Cacti breadcrumbs.
- Added visible Rack header tab icons.
- Plugin index.php now opens the rack topology page instead of returning to Cacti home.
- Upgrade routine now re-registers hooks.
